<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS2" title="In 5.2. Adaptive Mode Switching Strategies ‣ 5. Dynamic Scheduler ‣ FLYING SERVING: On-the-Fly Parallelism Switching for Large Language Model Serving" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.2 </span>Soft Preempt (Throughput-Oriented).</span></a></li>
